        "explanation": "Dorgan announces Bismarck State College's national designation and notes he authored the legislation creating it — claiming credit for both the legislative vehicle and the resulting benefit to a state institution."
      },
      {
        "document_id": "873",
        "explanation": "Landrieu claims Medicare's penalty waiver 'responds to urgent calls' made in her letter — credit-claiming by asserting her personal intervention caused an agency decision benefiting hurricane-affected seniors."
      }
    ]
  }
}
